yle**: Shoulder-length, neatly styled black hair that exudes an elegant and composed aura.  \n2. **Facial Features (Overall Image & Vibe)**: Soft yet well-proportioned facial features, blending sophistication and efficiency with a metropolitan woman’s refined charm.  \n3. **Physique**: Slender limbs and a graceful figure, projecting a healthy and confident image that captures the unique allure of a modern urban young woman.  \n4. **Attire**: Dressed in a white short-sleeved shirt and black shorts, paired with a black necktie. This business-casual fusion conveys professionalism, trendiness, and sophistication, suited for city life while embodying youthful energy, independence, and freedom.  \n\n### Four Dynamic Urban Personality Illustrations:  \n1. **Subway Station Scene**:  \n   - The character strides toward the subway platform, set against a bustling station backdrop. Holding a commuter bag (or phone) in one hand and the other in her pocket, she radiates confidence and efficiency. Her outfit appears sharp under cool white lighting, with strands of hair swaying slightly as she walks—capturing the fast-paced routine of a modern urban woman.  \n\n2. **Café Scene**:  \n   - Seated by a café window, she’s surrounded by work essentials like a laptop and phone, marking documents while sipping coffee. The lively street outside contrasts with the warm, focused ambiance framed by dark wooden tables and soft lighting. This shot highlights her composed and diligent work ethic.  \n\n3. **Luxury Mall Scene**:  \n   - Wearing stylish flats, she walks through a bright, expansive shopping mall. Carrying an elegant paper bag in one hand and holding her phone against her chest, her gaze locks onto a distant storefront. This showcases her refined taste in fashion and attention to detail, reflecting the lifestyle of a discerning modern woman.  \n\n4. **City Nightscape Scene**:  \n   - Against a dazzling urban nightscape, she leans lightly against a luxury car, gazing up at neon lights or the distant skyline. A slightly blurred background emphasizes her silhouette, while her monochrome outfit appears sleek and elevated under the night glow. Her pensive profile embodies freedom, confidence, and independence.  \n\nThis series of designs vividly captures the character’s efficient yet stylish urban persona, aligning with the image of metropolitan women pursuing high-quality lifestyles."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 2732, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 670, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "aedf917067de0dbe28663a59df2b3cadbc46ac99", "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 42}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [2603], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [470.49310302734375, 627.8248291015625], "pos": [-3551.19677734375, -1261.41455078125], "widgets_values": ["", "### 角色特征分析：\n1. **发型**：长发披肩，整齐自然的黑色发质，这种发型给人一种优雅而冷静的氛围。  \n2. **长相（整体形象气质）**：五官柔和且端正，整体气质显得文雅与干练并存，具有都会女性的精致感。  \n3. **身材**：修长的四肢，苗条的体态，给人一种健康而自信的形象，体现了现代都市女青年独特的韵味。  \n4. **穿着**：身着白色短袖衬衫和黑色短裤，搭配黑色领带。这种商务风与休闲结合的装扮，散发出干练、时尚又精致的个性，适合在都市场景中活动，同时具有混搭的年轻活力，象征独立与自由的精神。  \n\n### 四张城市动态个性图片设计：\n1. **地铁站场景**：\n   - 角色迈步走向地铁站台，背景可以是繁忙的地铁通道。她一手拿着通勤包（或手机），另一手插在口袋，展现自信与干练。她的服装在冷白灯光下显得格外利落，发丝随着步伐轻轻摆动，表现现代都市女性快节奏的日常。\n\n2. **咖啡馆场景**：\n   - 角色坐在窗边的咖啡馆内，身旁铺满笔记本电脑、手机等办公物品，一边低头圈画文件，一边喝咖啡。窗外背景是喧闹的街道，深色木桌与暖色灯光框出了轻松又集中的工作氛围。这张照片呈现她工作时认真沉静的一面。\n\n3. **高档商场场景**：\n   - 角色搭配一双时尚便鞋，行走在一个明亮宽阔的大型购物商场中。她一手提着一个典雅的纸袋，一手扶着胸前的手机，目光聚焦于远处的橱窗。展现细腻而精明的消费时尚，并侧面体现现代女性关注细节的生活态度。\n\n4. **城市夜景场景**：\n   - 在一个灯光璀璨的都市街头，角色轻靠在一辆高档轿车旁，仰头凝视霓虹灯或者远处的高楼天际线。背景可以稍微模糊以突出人物的轮廓，黑白穿搭在夜光下更显简约高级。她侧脸带着一丝思考，展现自由、自信与独立的精神。\n\n这组设计将充分展现角色在城市环境中的干练个性与时尚动态，同时呼应都市女性追求高品质生活的形象。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 2167, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 724, "type": "ShowTe